@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:那里已经有人捷足先登了。来者是玛格。|#0102Adv23_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:哎呀，真巧啊艾玛。|#0102Adv23_Margo001| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:你在这里做什么……？|#0102Adv23_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:搜查而已。<br>不用那么警惕我，现在我们还不是敌人呢。|#0102Adv23_Margo002| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:不过等审判开始以后，<br>我就不会手下留情了。呵呵。|#0102Adv23_Margo003| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:（现在是笑的时候吗……！）|#0102Adv23_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格嬉皮笑脸的样子<br>令艾玛感到反感。|#0102Adv23_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1,ArmR2

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛，你有想过<br>米莉亚交换身体的原因吗？|#0102Adv23_Margo004| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:忽然，玛格冷不丁地问道。|#0102Adv23_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我也很好奇，就去问了她本人。<br>但她没有正面回答我。|#0102Adv23_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我呢，之前有怀疑过<br>她的魔法是不是假的，<br>逼着她用过一回。|#0102Adv23_Margo005| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我跟她约好，一定会马上换回来，<br>让她对我用了魔法。|#0102Adv23_Margo006| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:欸！？什么时候的事……！|#0102Adv23_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Smile1,ArmR4

[PrintTextModified Text:呵呵，虽然她特别不情愿。<br>但她的魔法是真的。|#0102Adv23_Margo007| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆恍惚
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Smile1,ArmR6

[PrintTextModified Text:就在那短短的一瞬间，我变成了米莉亚。|#0102Adv23_Margo008| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格一脸如痴如醉状，<br>似乎在想像那时的情景。|#0102Adv23_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1,ArmR6

[PrintTextModified Text:可当我刚准备对米莉亚的身体玩点恶作剧的时候，<br>就马上回到自己的身体了。|#0102Adv23_Margo009| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（原来米莉亚的【互换】魔法<br>　是真的啊……）|#0102Adv23_Ema005|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@UpdateWitchBook Id:Miria Category:Profile Version:3
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Pensive1,ArmR6

[PrintTextModified Text:如果她确实交换了身体，<br>那么真正的米莉亚究竟在哪呢。|#0102Adv23_Margo010| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格一句无心的低语唤起了艾玛内心的在意。|#0102Adv23_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（真正的米莉亚……）|#0102Adv23_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:想到昨晚米莉亚那阴沉的表情和无力的自言自语，<br>艾玛的直觉告诉她，那就是真正的米莉亚。|#0102Adv23_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:顺便告诉你，我在这里没找到任何线索。<br>看来米莉亚还是个极度秘密主义者呢，<br>没有留下任何有关自己的痕迹。|#0102Adv23_Margo011| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如果不相信我的话，<br>你也可以亲自搜查一下。|#0102Adv23_Margo012| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……没关系，我相信你。<br>玛格，谢谢你告诉我情报。|#0102Adv23_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛离开了牢房。|#0102Adv23_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

